    "note": "MANUAL — tuned by hand or via ?debug=1 export. Scripts never write this file.",
    "units": "meters; rotations in degrees (XYZ order); positions are the module pivot (bottom-center of its bounds) in tree space, origin = ground at trunk center",
    "size": "real-world length of the module along `axis`; runtime scale = meters / manifest.bounds.size[axis]",
    "status": "Tahap 4 (confirmed by owner 2026-10-27): internal modules fitted to the 4 trunk compartments measured from geometry (floors y 0.18 / 0.415 / 0.63 / 0.87 m).",
    "explode": "explode.approach = unit direction the module enters its slot from (hover point = slot + approach × config.assembly.hover); explode.clear = straight travel along approach before turning toward explode.position (m), so internal modules slide out of their compartment first. A module whose explode.position equals its slot never moves.",
    "focus": "focus: camera fly-to on select. Target = center of the module bounds; camera = target + normalize(direction) × distance (m). Internal modules are viewed from the front (+Z), where the compartments open.",
    "shots": "shots: camera per chapter (position + orbit target, m). fit = [width, height] of the subject in meters: the camera backs off along the same direction until it fits the screen area not covered by overlay panels (core/viewport.js). Intro is nearly level so the ground disc stays below the hero text. water frames the trunk interior and the four branch roots (Tahap 10); dashboard/roadmap use the overview until Tahap 11–12."
